@base = http://localhost

### Ambience categories
GET {{base}}/api/ambience/categories

### All ambiences
GET {{base}}/api/ambience

### Single ambience by id
GET {{base}}/api/ambience/precipitation.rain

### Scene categories
GET {{base}}/api/scene/categories

### All scenes
GET {{base}}/api/scene

### Single scene by id
GET {{base}}/api/scene/abyssus

### Playlist categories
GET {{base}}/api/music/playlist/categories

### All playlists
GET {{base}}/api/music/playlist

### Single playlist by id
GET {{base}}/api/music/playlist/borealis

### Trigger R2 re-scan
POST {{base}}/api/admin/sync
Content-Type: application/json
